[{:db/id "q-51040/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81" :answer/id #uuid "752b61ef-cf9e-5df2-b7f1-8730755744a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{DNE}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51040/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "72e77f26-9e95-5a66-bb65-9d6a76d2c8c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51040/selection/64ee21896e4acdba2b7ccd5d21e7c3b0caad319fb011e671d6ce72f671b3bb6c" :answer/id #uuid "927396ed-3d18-5117-a521-47237b7ff8d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\infty " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51040/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer/id #uuid "acd3c93d-afa6-5d2a-8cf0-e9513b65f1af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51040/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "8f111ab8-b720-57e5-8afd-545fbcc9b0cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51040/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ba7360ea-2b42-5549-809f-306a8b78a2a3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-51040/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer-field/choices ["q-51040/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81" "q-51040/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-51040/selection/64ee21896e4acdba2b7ccd5d21e7c3b0caad319fb011e671d6ce72f671b3bb6c" "q-51040/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" "q-51040/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-51040" :question/id #uuid "b6bd49bc-86e4-5ec8-9bf9-75f8b341fe2d" :question/math-academy-id "q-51040" :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+1}-1}{x}.$" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+1}-1}{x} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{0+1}-1}{0}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the numerator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the numerator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+1}-1}{x} & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{(\\sqrt{x+1}-1)(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)}{x(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{(\\sqrt{x+1})}^{2}-{1}^{2}}{x(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{x+1-1}{x(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{x}{x(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x+1}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0+1}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-51040/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a441c8ef-b5b3-5438-97b9-53e4eb7b2d75"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-51040"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-302299/field-1/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "98e58c33-27e1-524e-a5f4-011ccf164971" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-302299/field-1/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "6e309da2-8437-59fc-8ae7-12d5aa4f7bd8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-302299/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "cb94437b-fe96-54b0-bf3f-fe8f95d05890" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-302299/field-1/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer-field/choices ["q-302299/field-1/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" "q-302299/field-1/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-302299" :question/id #uuid "928f5c43-06f8-5c3f-a444-97bf8f60a1a7" :question/math-academy-id "q-302299" :question/problem "Evaluate the following limit:\n\n${lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+7}-2}{x+3}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+7}-2}{x+3} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{-3+7}-2}{-3+3}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the numerator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the numerator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+7}-2}{x+3} & ={lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{(\\sqrt{x+7}-2)(\\sqrt{x+7}+2)}{(x+3)(\\sqrt{x+7}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{(\\sqrt{x+7})^{2}-{2}^{2}}{(x+3)(\\sqrt{x+7}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{(x+7)-4}{(x+3)(\\sqrt{x+7}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{x+3}{(x+3)(\\sqrt{x+7}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{\\cancel{x+3}}{\\cancel{(x+3)}(\\sqrt{x+7}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x+7}+2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{-3+7}+2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4}+2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2+2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-302299/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a441c8ef-b5b3-5438-97b9-53e4eb7b2d75"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-302299"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-46836/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "ba3bd9ad-46b5-5b5b-af9d-15d1cfe26e25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46836/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "10b3c357-dcfc-5159-8432-10898d99d730" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46836/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "b943676f-9b86-523b-bbd2-c3877a896979" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46836/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "6372f19d-b3d6-5092-96d6-9a004a5f6b58" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46836/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81" :answer/id #uuid "a94c5e51-df00-584c-a16b-d01f0c4ad868" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{DNE}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46836/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "64af54df-7bcd-51af-bbb5-6611722066de" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-46836/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer-field/choices ["q-46836/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-46836/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" "q-46836/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" "q-46836/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-46836/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-46836" :question/id #uuid "81ec06e5-cd6a-551e-b7a2-2fdfb120cf7f" :question/math-academy-id "q-46836" :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to (64)^{-}}\\frac{x-8\\sqrt{x}}{x-64}.$" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to (64)^{-}}\\frac{x-8\\sqrt{x}}{x-64} & =\\frac{64-8\\sqrt{64}}{64-64}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the numerator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the numerator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to (64)^{-}}\\frac{x-8\\sqrt{x}}{x-64} & ={lim}_{x\\to (64)^{-}}\\frac{(x-8\\sqrt{x})(x+8\\sqrt{x})}{(x-64)(x+8\\sqrt{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to (64)^{-}}\\frac{{x}^{2}-{(8\\sqrt{x})}^{2}}{(x-64)(x+8\\sqrt{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to (64)^{-}}\\frac{{x}^{2}-64x}{(x-64)(x+8\\sqrt{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to (64)^{-}}\\frac{x(x-64)}{(x-64)(x+8\\sqrt{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to (64)^{-}}\\frac{x}{x+8\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{64}{64+8\\sqrt{64}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-46836/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a441c8ef-b5b3-5438-97b9-53e4eb7b2d75"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46836"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-46831/selection/f2288f9352f7ca2a51938247a89477aea196296ae7b20690ce35ebb30dfe5331" :answer/id #uuid "3e47abe8-ec8c-5c9c-b680-47a9eb83e40c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{16}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46831/selection/393522ee4ded7288062e6072c329c38ecb06c9de712f11faf938346737b8d6d5" :answer/id #uuid "8177625e-0fcd-5d78-8f77-7ad6c29a7ae2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{24}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46831/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81" :answer/id #uuid "22179b09-8761-585b-871e-5bb6d504d869" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{DNE}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46831/selection/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" :answer/id #uuid "e658e508-987f-5a4f-8f2e-ec2f8203d053" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46831/selection/64ee21896e4acdba2b7ccd5d21e7c3b0caad319fb011e671d6ce72f671b3bb6c" :answer/id #uuid "fc2e0f3a-8505-59a5-925d-db93ef752c28" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\infty " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46831/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "846cf5ca-7696-5b32-a145-e9f822d54432" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-46831/selection/f2288f9352f7ca2a51938247a89477aea196296ae7b20690ce35ebb30dfe5331" :answer-field/choices ["q-46831/selection/f2288f9352f7ca2a51938247a89477aea196296ae7b20690ce35ebb30dfe5331" "q-46831/selection/393522ee4ded7288062e6072c329c38ecb06c9de712f11faf938346737b8d6d5" "q-46831/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81" "q-46831/selection/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" "q-46831/selection/64ee21896e4acdba2b7ccd5d21e7c3b0caad319fb011e671d6ce72f671b3bb6c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-46831" :question/id #uuid "51433638-23de-5865-9a91-de5431948eea" :question/math-academy-id "q-46831" :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+2}-2}{{x}^{2}-4}.$" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+2}-2}{{x}^{2}-4} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2+2}-2}{{2}^{2}-4}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the numerator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the numerator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+2}-2}{{x}^{2}-4} & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+2}-2}{(x-2)(x+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{(\\sqrt{x+2}-2)(\\sqrt{x+2}+2)}{(x-2)(x+2)(\\sqrt{x+2}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{{(\\sqrt{x+2})}^{2}-{2}^{2}}{(x-2)(x+2)(\\sqrt{x+2}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{x+2-4}{(x-2)(x+2)(\\sqrt{x+2}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{x-2}{(x-2)(x+2)(\\sqrt{x+2}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{1}{(x+2)(\\sqrt{x+2}+2)} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(2+2)(\\sqrt{2+2}+2)} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{16}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-46831/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a441c8ef-b5b3-5438-97b9-53e4eb7b2d75"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46831"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-46838/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "23eb41e1-df86-5d23-b317-2c9449eb29ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46838/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81" :answer/id #uuid "659ab017-b94c-5292-b78f-13b403f41670" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{DNE}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46838/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "d5a9454a-fd37-5f0a-94d4-516aff72fd65" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46838/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "4c6042be-68e6-5614-b52d-6187961da820" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46838/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "c39a0edb-c621-53b4-845d-43c733153aa0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46838/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c3bffd14-44d5-5a70-ab62-289469c303c9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-46838/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-46838/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-46838/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81" "q-46838/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-46838/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-46838/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-46838" :question/id #uuid "c2192068-6d96-59a7-8da5-820238c32032" :question/math-academy-id "q-46838" :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to {25}^{-}}\\frac{2x-10\\sqrt{x}}{x-25}.$" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to {25}^{-}}\\frac{2x-10\\sqrt{x}}{x-25} & =\\frac{50-10\\sqrt{25}}{25-25}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the numerator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the numerator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to {25}^{-}}\\frac{2x-10\\sqrt{x}}{x-25} & ={lim}_{x\\to {25}^{-}}\\frac{2(x-5\\sqrt{x})}{x-25} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {25}^{-}}\\frac{2(x-5\\sqrt{x})(x+5\\sqrt{x})}{(x-25)(x+5\\sqrt{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {25}^{-}}\\frac{2({x}^{2}-{(5\\sqrt{x})}^{2})}{(x-25)(x+5\\sqrt{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {25}^{-}}\\frac{2({x}^{2}-25x)}{(x-25)(x+5\\sqrt{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {25}^{-}}\\frac{2x(x-25)}{(x-25)(x+5\\sqrt{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {25}^{-}}\\frac{2x}{x+5\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2(25)}{25+5\\sqrt{25}} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-46838/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a441c8ef-b5b3-5438-97b9-53e4eb7b2d75"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46838"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-101288/selection/c62ffe10e0f7a21bbc0da3f299beb262645e0317a8785a936e2ddbf14d0ab2b8" :answer/id #uuid "136c30fa-9044-52a8-8a49-837a101f76ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\sqrt{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-101288/selection/1af1be23805790c46357e9fb162ca653a9aaa7ac9fc36768624c7a181010a146" :answer/id #uuid "e9522321-d07c-5a20-b5a9-f2ebff52419f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-101288/selection/689dcc878a7211816a43b3efed9f28492a43fffef3a25297777c0abb37e2560d" :answer/id #uuid "1b2dbd48-6baf-5e15-bbfb-b49df51606ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-101288/selection/6aa0658ec3b64327f8a2d599faa4f715c940036c4e92b012fbfb8370208f2e7d" :answer/id #uuid "934ab8eb-0b43-5dbc-8b63-94acc00d4e00" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-101288/selection/d3a7133ef1a1f6526aaec763d522f5ae075d8386a4606de90dcb93094f1d21d6" :answer/id #uuid "f330557c-b754-5f71-a0c9-29586f4eec50" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-101288/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "cdaf86b8-fe13-5914-bc47-1912531cc01e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-101288/selection/689dcc878a7211816a43b3efed9f28492a43fffef3a25297777c0abb37e2560d" :answer-field/choices ["q-101288/selection/c62ffe10e0f7a21bbc0da3f299beb262645e0317a8785a936e2ddbf14d0ab2b8" "q-101288/selection/1af1be23805790c46357e9fb162ca653a9aaa7ac9fc36768624c7a181010a146" "q-101288/selection/689dcc878a7211816a43b3efed9f28492a43fffef3a25297777c0abb37e2560d" "q-101288/selection/6aa0658ec3b64327f8a2d599faa4f715c940036c4e92b012fbfb8370208f2e7d" "q-101288/selection/d3a7133ef1a1f6526aaec763d522f5ae075d8386a4606de90dcb93094f1d21d6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-101288" :question/id #uuid "4657fda3-adb3-52a6-b9ad-8af5d9861fcc" :question/math-academy-id "q-101288" :question/problem "${lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{x-2}{\\sqrt{3x+1}-\\sqrt{7}}=$" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit by simply evaluating the function at $x=2$, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{x-2}{\\sqrt{3x+1}-\\sqrt{7}} & =\\frac{2-2}{\\sqrt{3(2)+1}-\\sqrt{7}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2-2}{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{7}} \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the denominator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{x-2}{\\sqrt{3x+1}-\\sqrt{7}} & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{(x-2)(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})}{(\\sqrt{3x+1}-\\sqrt{7})(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{(x-2)(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})}{(\\sqrt{3x+1})^{2}-(\\sqrt{7})^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{(x-2)(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})}{3x+1-7} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{(x-2)(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})}{3x-6} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{(x-2)(\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7})}{3(x-2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 2}\\frac{\\sqrt{3x+1}+\\sqrt{7}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3(2)+1}+\\sqrt{7}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{7}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-101288/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "045722b6-b558-522b-86e1-322c64e2848f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-101288"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-46830/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "b7ef5d52-0ace-50cd-a442-9f7fa422209c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46830/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "bf9681e0-3ae3-5e93-8c39-dab786af18f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46830/selection/64ee21896e4acdba2b7ccd5d21e7c3b0caad319fb011e671d6ce72f671b3bb6c" :answer/id #uuid "7075f757-bf4a-509a-84e1-ce323960eb1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\infty " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46830/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "4e1edee0-0602-5ee9-8b5b-998c3d270b7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46830/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81" :answer/id #uuid "c6a4cff1-21c9-5c7c-9b32-e63d75df8c24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{DNE}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46830/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5c40c8fa-e118-58fb-8b13-d3cdad09628e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-46830/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-46830/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" "q-46830/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-46830/selection/64ee21896e4acdba2b7ccd5d21e7c3b0caad319fb011e671d6ce72f671b3bb6c" "q-46830/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-46830/selection/c5e624c1da93ecfedccf3fa70b8e1fb64de1e5d703dcc02fa7b4793f81a70f81"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-46830" :question/id #uuid "b7ad57fc-300b-5ef8-bc85-cd0a410390d4" :question/math-academy-id "q-46830" :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}\\frac{x-4}{\\sqrt{3x-3}-3}.$" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit by simply evaluating the function at $x=4$, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}\\frac{x-4}{\\sqrt{3x-3}-3} & =\\frac{4-4}{\\sqrt{3(4)-3}-3}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the denominator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}\\frac{x-4}{\\sqrt{3x-3}-3} & ={lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}\\frac{(x-4)(\\sqrt{3x-3}+3)}{(\\sqrt{3x-3}-3)(\\sqrt{3x-3}+3)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}\\frac{(x-4)(\\sqrt{3x-3}+3)}{{(\\sqrt{3x-3})}^{2}-{3}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}\\frac{(x-4)(\\sqrt{3x-3}+3)}{3x-3-9} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}\\frac{(x-4)(\\sqrt{3x-3}+3)}{3x-12} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}\\frac{(x-4)(\\sqrt{3x-3}+3)}{3(x-4)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}\\frac{\\sqrt{3x-3}+3}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3(4)-3}+3}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{3+3}{3} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-46830/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "045722b6-b558-522b-86e1-322c64e2848f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46830"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-107061/selection/537a654236bf591ad70beee055cae1766239cb8945f026650870d8def5cbf713" :answer/id #uuid "088025b3-5bf8-54a0-94c8-c5a91722b66c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107061/selection/bc3ea608e702d2b2cf8c3081fc327a47053f4dc5546a3d0f1bd8838c5e6af1b7" :answer/id #uuid "10bb0c40-de35-54d3-b6a4-f0778529ddda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{10}+\\sqrt{8}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107061/selection/845d63f8f4b86d23095d4c175c81c765ed29edeb51255badd8e586283b8cfdbe" :answer/id #uuid "92c6c019-a5db-5765-b3f5-3818c96c8238" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3+\\sqrt{8}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107061/selection/8551f4ab982fcde1f823c1977548aa17e8676df39a3695767fd216f31d51658b" :answer/id #uuid "ab88ca0e-2503-5f26-b2d1-09ec8553c4dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107061/selection/8a135ace4937b1ffa2c52fbce040999428005f5395e9d793e225144a0384a1ba" :answer/id #uuid "8b43acc7-0c84-54f3-851a-f4dd2ab602ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107061/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a3ec61d9-9722-566e-a4dc-a25d7cc83391" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-107061/selection/537a654236bf591ad70beee055cae1766239cb8945f026650870d8def5cbf713" :answer-field/choices ["q-107061/selection/537a654236bf591ad70beee055cae1766239cb8945f026650870d8def5cbf713" "q-107061/selection/bc3ea608e702d2b2cf8c3081fc327a47053f4dc5546a3d0f1bd8838c5e6af1b7" "q-107061/selection/845d63f8f4b86d23095d4c175c81c765ed29edeb51255badd8e586283b8cfdbe" "q-107061/selection/8551f4ab982fcde1f823c1977548aa17e8676df39a3695767fd216f31d51658b" "q-107061/selection/8a135ace4937b1ffa2c52fbce040999428005f5395e9d793e225144a0384a1ba"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-107061" :question/id #uuid "64c040bb-f60c-52a5-9d30-9e6aa3009832" :question/math-academy-id "q-107061" :question/problem "${lim}_{x\\to 3}\\frac{x-3}{\\sqrt{3x-1}-\\sqrt{8}}=$" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit by simply evaluating the function at $x=3$, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 3}\\frac{x-3}{\\sqrt{3x-1}-\\sqrt{8}} & =\\frac{3-3}{\\sqrt{3(3)-1}-\\sqrt{8}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3-3}{\\sqrt{8}-\\sqrt{8}} \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the denominator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 3}\\frac{x-3}{\\sqrt{3x-1}-\\sqrt{8}} & ={lim}_{x\\to 3}\\frac{(x-3)(\\sqrt{3x-1}+\\sqrt{8})}{(\\sqrt{3x-1}-\\sqrt{8})(\\sqrt{3x-1}+\\sqrt{8})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 3}\\frac{(x-3)(\\sqrt{3x-1}+\\sqrt{8})}{(\\sqrt{3x-1})^{2}-(\\sqrt{8})^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 3}\\frac{(x-3)(\\sqrt{3x-1}+\\sqrt{8})}{3x-1-8} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 3}\\frac{(x-3)(\\sqrt{3x-1}+\\sqrt{8})}{3(x-3)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 3}\\frac{\\sqrt{3x-1}+\\sqrt{8}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3(3)-1}+\\sqrt{8}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{8}+\\sqrt{8}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{8}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-107061/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "045722b6-b558-522b-86e1-322c64e2848f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107061"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-338515/field-1/80f9bea33aa6a89d127ee9002c35787893c3c59b57df469ba089cea1a4a6a472" :answer/id #uuid "e5b4e8a5-a2cc-5f7c-9777-ff4b3cf574bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338515/field-1/9ab64b945e95c1c3798cea70f4ae7ad55133b01b9b894848e70b56c91ffbae97" :answer/id #uuid "a5cfa902-4e4d-535a-9d48-b74e92e2614f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338515/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc7bd336-dc82-597d-938b-ca1bda73e817" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-338515/field-1/80f9bea33aa6a89d127ee9002c35787893c3c59b57df469ba089cea1a4a6a472" :answer-field/choices ["q-338515/field-1/80f9bea33aa6a89d127ee9002c35787893c3c59b57df469ba089cea1a4a6a472" "q-338515/field-1/9ab64b945e95c1c3798cea70f4ae7ad55133b01b9b894848e70b56c91ffbae97"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-338515" :question/id #uuid "4f682dc1-21d5-50c6-a843-a82f4d54fb3f" :question/math-academy-id "q-338515" :question/problem "Evaluate the following limit:\n\n${lim}_{z\\to 6}\\frac{z-6}{\\sqrt{3z-2}-4}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit by simply evaluating the function at $z=6,$ we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{z\\to 6}\\frac{z-6}{\\sqrt{3z-2}-4} & =\\frac{6-6}{\\sqrt{3(6)-2}-4}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the denominator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{z\\to 6}\\frac{z-6}{\\sqrt{3z-2}-4} & ={lim}_{z\\to 6}\\frac{(z-6)(\\sqrt{3z-2}+4)}{(\\sqrt{3z-2}-4)(\\sqrt{3z-2}+4)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{z\\to 6}\\frac{(z-6)(\\sqrt{3z-2}+4)}{(\\sqrt{3z-2})^{2}-{4}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{z\\to 6}\\frac{(z-6)(\\sqrt{3z-2}+4)}{(3z-2)-16} \\\\  & ={lim}_{z\\to 6}\\frac{(z-6)(\\sqrt{3z-2}+4)}{3z-18} \\\\  & ={lim}_{z\\to 6}\\frac{(z-6)(\\sqrt{3z-2}+4)}{3(z-6)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{z\\to 6}\\frac{\\sqrt{3z-2}+4}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3(6)-2}+4}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{4+4}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-338515/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "045722b6-b558-522b-86e1-322c64e2848f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-338515"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-338499/field-1/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "ce584506-2795-558d-b996-4516410cfc88" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338499/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "a96e2238-390d-594b-9be4-12bad99b389a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-338499/field-1/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer-field/choices ["q-338499/field-1/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-338499" :question/id #uuid "f5c72df1-9772-5859-9f99-47b53efc1e38" :question/math-academy-id "q-338499" :question/problem "Evaluate the following limit:\n\n${lim}_{x\\to 64}\\frac{x-64}{\\sqrt{4x}-16}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If we attempt to evaluate the limit by simply evaluating the function at $x=64,$ we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 64}\\frac{x-64}{\\sqrt{4x}-16} & =\\frac{64-64}{\\sqrt{4(64)}-16}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the denominator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 64}\\frac{x-64}{\\sqrt{4x}-16} & ={lim}_{x\\to 64}\\frac{(x-64)(\\sqrt{4x}+16)}{(\\sqrt{4x}-16)(\\sqrt{4x}+16)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 64}\\frac{(x-64)(\\sqrt{4x}+16)}{(\\sqrt{4x})^{2}-{16}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 64}\\frac{(x-64)(\\sqrt{4x}+16)}{4x-256} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 64}\\frac{(x-64)(\\sqrt{4x}+16)}{4(x-64)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 64}\\frac{\\cancel{(x-64)}(\\sqrt{4x}+16)}{4\\cancel{(x-64)}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 64}\\frac{\\sqrt{4x}+16}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{4(64)}+16}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{16+16}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{4} \\\\  & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-338499/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "045722b6-b558-522b-86e1-322c64e2848f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-338499"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
